# Original camera/screenshot files. They stay on disk so the webp set can be
# rebuilt, but they must never be committed: everything under assets/img/ is
# published by GitHub Pages, and the originals still show the real student ID
# and the PSU Passport username that the published webp versions paint out.
_source-images/

# Motion prototypes. They stay on disk so the owner can open them side by side
# with the real page, but they must never be committed: every .html at the root
# is served by GitHub Pages, so a committed prototype is a half-finished page
# that anyone who guesses the URL can read. The owner's ruling on 2026-08-02 was
# "ผมพอใจอยู่ โดยรวม แต่ยังไม่ให้เอาไปเป็นตัวจริงนะ" — see docs/PLAN-MOTION.md.
# Delete these lines only when a prototype is promoted to the real index.html.
index-motion.html
index-motion_2.html
index-niika.html

